=================================================

WHAT IS IT?
===========
A Caja extension to backup/restore files/folders in an easy way from a contextual menu.


HOW DO I INSTALL & RUN IT?
==========================

For Ubuntu

    $ sudo apt install deja-dup-caja

From source (see dependencies below)

    $ bzr branch lp:deja-dup-caja
    $ cd deja-dup-caja
    $ sudo python3 setup.py install --prefix=/usr

Then, restart Caja

    $ caja -q


DEPENDENCIES
============
For Caja:
    caja, deja-dup, gir1.2-caja-2.0, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-caja
